Capco is looking for a&nbsp; Strategy &amp; Transformation Consultant to strengthen our project team.&nbsp;

We are looking for a talented and versatile consultant with a first relevant professional experience, who is eager to further develop within a dynamic consulting environment.&nbsp;

You combine strong analytical and strategic thinking with a hands-on mindset, quickly get up to speed on new topics and are comfortable taking ownership of your work.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

What will you do?&nbsp;

• Support the project team on strategic and organisational topics.&nbsp;

• Analyse and structure complex information and translate it into clear insights.&nbsp;

• Prepare high-quality analyses and presentations for various stakeholders.

• Support organisational change and improvement initiatives.&nbsp;

• Prepare and support workshops and stakeholder meetings.&nbsp;

Who are we looking for?&nbsp;

You are a proactive and versatile consultant who can switch easily between analyses, strategic thinking and hands-on execution.&nbsp;

Ideally, you bring:&nbsp;

• 1-3 years of relevant professional experience, ideally within consulting, financial services, strategy, transformation or organisational change.

• Strong analytical and problem-solving skills

• Fluency in Dutch and an excellent professional knowledge of English.&nbsp;

• Experience with Target Operating Models is a plus.

• Experience within Capital Markets is a plus.&nbsp;

Location

You will work 3 days per week on-site in Amsterdam, with the remaining days based in Belgium.&nbsp;

What do we offer?&nbsp;

You will join an international and dynamic consulting environment, where you will have the opportunity to work on challenging projects.&nbsp;

We offer an attractive salary package, including:&nbsp;

• Company car or mobility budget

• Annual bonus

• Meal vouchers

• Eco vouchers

• Net allowance

• 12 additional ADV days

